MySQLi: access to MySQL and MariaDB servers, through mysqlnd. With
php83-mysqlnd; php83-mysqli-openssl is the same for
php83-mysqlnd-openssl.

The module mysqli of PHP 8.3 for php83 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20230831/mysqli.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php83/conf.d, its
headers in include/php83/php/ext/mysqli.
